          "request": {
            "name": "Get custodians",
            "description": {
              "content": "Get all custodians for the language and region specified in the `Accept-Language` header.</br></br>The response returns the unique `documentName` and `documentShortName` values that identify custodians. At least one of these values is required when making a POST request to the `statement-details` endpoint. </br></br>The response separates the supported custodians into two lists. The `mainCustodians` list contains custodians for whom specific processing logic has been written.  The `others` list contains custodians for whom common processing logic is used and may therefore produce results with a lower degree of accuracy.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
